: \"AC3: git diff -- src/ tests/는 비어 있다. AC4: docs/RISKS.md diff는 R15 한 줄의 단일 hunk다. AC5: AGENTS.md와 CLAUDE.md의 R15 행은 완전히 같다.\",\r\nphases\\17-total-unconfirmed-risk\\step0-report.json-15-  \"gates\": {\r\nphases\\17-total-unconfirmed-risk\\step0-report.json-16-    \"test\": \"passed — 82 files, 1429 tests\",\r\nphases\\17-total-unconfirmed-risk\\step0-report.json-17-    \"golden\": \"passed — 7 files, 362 tests\",\r\n--\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-5-    {\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-6-      \"step\": 0,\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-7-      \"name\": \"verify-adr036-premises\",\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-8-      \"kind\": \"verify\",\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-9-      \"status\": \"completed\",\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-10-      \"started_at\": \"2026-08-26T17:06:39+0900\",\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json:11:      \"summary\": \"ADR-036의 여섯 전제를 실행 반례와 픽스처 대조로 모두 upheld로 확인하고 step0-report.json을 작성했다.\",\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-12-      \"completed_at\": \"2026-08-26T17:19:53+0900\"\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-13-    },\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-14-    {\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-15-      \"step\": 1,\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-16-      \"name\": \"wall-class-domain-rulepack\",\r\nphases\\24-wall-class\\index.json-17-      \"status\": \"completed\",\r\n--- current phase index raw ---\r\n{\r\n  \"project\": \"Kijun\",\r\n  \"phase\": \"27-cantilever-slab\",\r\n  \"steps\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"step\": 0,\r\n      \"name\": \"verify-adr039-premises\",\r\n      \"kind\": \"verify\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\r\n      \"started_at\": \"2026-08-26T23:18:13+0900\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"step\": 1,\r\n      \"name\": \"cantilever-domain-rulepack-golden\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"step\": 2,\r\n      \"name\": \"cantilever-viewer-plan-place\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"st